<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Irvine Apartment raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Irvine Apartment raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers analyst Jordan Heller said he raised his rating on Irvine Apartment Communities Inc to buy from hold and forecast higher growth due to better rent increases and improved operating margins.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 1/4 at 23-1/4.</p>
</text>
